A machine learning model that uses a decision 
tree must repeatedly refine its criteria.

2
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,880
The more data input, the more accurate it becomes.

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,040
This is called training.

4
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:18,160
Use what you have learned to draw 
a decision tree that allows you  

